Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_11","text":"Mune?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_12","text":"Yes, my buddy, Mune!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_13","text":"Rupee said that it helps","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_14","text":"complete the look I'm going for,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_15","text":"so she bought it for me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_16","text":"And she gave it a name?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_17","text":"Yeah, apparently it's from an old story.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_18","text":"Although I don't know much about the details.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_19","text":"To be honest, her naming it made me happier","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_20","text":"than the gift itself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_21","text":"It's a fitting name, and it does look pretty cute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_22","text":"I know, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_23","text":"Whenever it flies,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_24","text":"it likes to hover above my head.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_25","text":"Teacher,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_26","text":"would you like to play with Mune, too?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_27","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_27","text":"I'm sure it'd prefer being around you.","jump":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_29"},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_28","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_28","text":"Sure, I'll have a go.","jump":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_31"},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_29","text":"It would?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_30","text":"It'd be nice if it got along with you too.","jump":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_32"},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_31","text":"All right! I'm sure you and Mune will get along great.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_32","text":"Just one more thing...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_33","text":"... Huh. What was I going to say again?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_34","text":"I forgot.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_35","text":"I got so excited that I forgot to write it down in my notebook.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_36","text":"Well, tell me when you remember it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02_37","text":"Will do!","jump":null}],"chat":true}